            <ArticleTitle>[How to care for the backs of the caretakers].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>9-12, 14, 16</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Rachis mechanical syndrome is especially frequent among nursing professionals, probably due to ergonomic and psychological factors. In order to prevent this syndrome, and to accelerate recovery from it, correct posture and, moreover regular physical exercises constitute the best current methods available.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
